## My Daily Khata – Expense Tracker
**Version:** 1.0  
**Platform:** Flutter for Android and iOS  
**Primary currency:** Indian Rupees (INR — ₹)  
**Languages:** English and Odia (ଓଡ଼ିଆ)  
**Storage:** Offline-first local database with optional secure cloud backup  
**Security:** PIN and biometric authentication  
**Application type:** Personal and family finance management

